
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>PROOFLY</title>

<style>
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #100c2c, #30205c, #7251a0);
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
}

header {
    padding: 25px;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    color: #e8caff;
}

main {
    padding: 65px 20px;
}

h1 {
    font-size: 42px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

h2 {
    color: #e8caff;
    font-size: 23px;
}

p {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.8;
}

button {
    background: #d9b5ff;
    color: #24143f;
    border: none;
    padding: 15px 30px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
}

.card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    padding: 25px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 35px auto;
}

footer {
    padding: 25px;
    color: #d8c7ed;
    font-size: 14px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>PROOFLY</header>

<main>
    <h1>Welcome to PROOFLY</h1>

    <h2>Trust begins with proof.</h2>

    <div class="card">
        <p>
        Welcome to my first website.
        I am learning software development
        and building something meaningful.
        </p>
    </div>

    <button>Explore PROOFLY</button>
</main>

<footer>
    © 2026 PROOFLY | Built with ambition.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
